<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00335/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<strong>项目描述：</strong>一行带有模因的文字，会使观察者产生极度反感并拒绝记忆位于与项目之前的内容。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>各类书籍<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>未被完全收容<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">以下为一个典型范例</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">收起</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<h3><span>要求全文背诵</span></h3>
</div>
